      "content": "The idea that your absence would bring them peace is a deeply ingrained, yet ultimately false, conclusion. Your pain is real, but so is the possibility of change, and you are not defined by your mistakes. There are people who want to help you see a different path forward, a way to stop the cycle without ending it. Please consider talking to a professional who can offer you support and a different perspective.",
